{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way through varied western locations in an intense battle for order in the lawless Wild West.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saloonery offers 8 main missions, 16 side missions, 11 enemy types, 11 different weapons, and 4 difficulties.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain down justice with a rifle or run and gun with a shotgun \u2014 the varied arsenal of weapons at your disposal guarantees you won't be lacking in hot lead dispensers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Duck and Weave with Bullet Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize your character's lightning quick reflexes to dodge past bullets and land the killing shot. The bad guys may have overwhelming numbers, but they're no match for your super human fast draw. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer to strike fast and deal damage up close or take down enemies from a distance, you\u2019ll find plenty of ways to enhance your combat prowess with skill upgrades.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227060?t=1744917692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227060?t=1744917692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227060/2c6066ff3b030ef265d67a13e7470fa6bed5ec8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227060/2c6066ff3b030ef265d67a13e7470fa6bed5ec8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3228270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way through varied western locations in an intense battle for order in the lawless Wild West.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saloonery offers 8 main missions, 16 side missions, 11 enemy types, 11 different weapons, and 4 difficulties.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain down justice with a rifle or run and gun with a shotgun \u2014 the varied arsenal of weapons at your disposal guarantees you won't be lacking in hot lead dispensers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Duck and Weave with Bullet Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize your character's lightning quick reflexes to dodge past bullets and land the killing shot. The bad guys may have overwhelming numbers, but they're no match for your super human fast draw. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer to strike fast and deal damage up close or take down enemies from a distance, you\u2019ll find plenty of ways to enhance your combat prowess with skill upgrades.</p>","developers":["Bow Tie Cat Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227060/header.jpg?t=1744917692","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116991,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116991/movie480.mp4?t=1742565990","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116991/movie_max.mp4?t=1742565990"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116991/be833638650e515f2a074799ebca2744fc478fe8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742565990"